    "detailed_description": "You have died and awakened with no memories in a strange place.<br>Explore and discover what happened to you as you face powerful enemies.<br>However at the end of your journey, will you be able to raise your soul?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859550/extras/43a5305b0cbab2062b7c15ea8bc6247c.poster.avif?t=1710220355\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859550/extras/43a5305b0cbab2062b7c15ea8bc6247c.webm?t=1710220355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859550/extras/43a5305b0cbab2062b7c15ea8bc6247c.mp4?t=1710220355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859550/extras/caf7daa6a897f5ebaf646c63cc5255b4.webp?t=1710220355\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Combat System inspired by Dark Souls Series (lock-on, dodge, third person)<br></li><li> Progression System (Level Up and Weapon Skill Tree)<br></li><li> Challenging Bosses<br></li><li> Inventory/Equipment System<br></li><li> Epic Bosses Sountracks<br></li><li> Replayability - New Game Plus and Memories System<br></li><li> Memories system - &quot;Remember&quot; a already defeated boss and face him again.</li></ul>",
